differential2 §11b. __getattr__ dispatch for attributes not resolved
by normal lookup: declared fields still read directly (c.x), unknown
attributes route to __getattr__ (c.missing), and the hook is found via
the MRO so an inherited __getattr__ also applies (Sub().anything).
